+    // full -ub that projection (~1.6-1.7 GiB/device) is what makes the target's own first-prefill
+    // compute growth run out of VRAM on 2 GPUs.  The draft only ever drafts n_max+1 tokens, so a small
+    // chunk is all it needs: 512 keeps the injection fast (2 GPU cache-off -ub 8192 prefill 1634 t/s vs
+    // 1290 at n_max+1) and still frees the memory.  `MTP_DRAFT_N_UBATCH` overrides it.
+    // TODO #42 follow-up: the underlying defect is the target's reserve being ~426 MiB short of its own
+    // first prefill (a grow-in-place realloc that is fragmentation-sensitive); fix that and the cap can
